{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_034_01_a",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e940f8ee3eb6003a9b10ba5d65136e253533f2fc49deea9ff09acffcef6a20e6",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2620b13db0d0dd9dcd4e7f3bf2832af3124e81813014fe3f98f4bad86fa0370c",
      "text": "憧憬的偶像",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7bc767cb747f53972ce64d087382b7117b9ad4cae5aa6434eb71e1300e76ee36",
      "text": "第一次打招呼时因受到冬马的亲切对待，\n花音成了他的粉丝。听说接到了和冬马\n一起的工作，花音干劲十足。\n但是在练习中却很难碰面，\n于是花音采取了某个行动……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000011:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000011:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2620b13db0d0dd9dcd4e7f3bf2832af3124e81813014fe3f98f4bad86fa0370c",
      "text": "憧憬的偶像",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000013:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d97839694a88d3dbaae2835aa42718463b83dd8670118274c73ca9eac5ddd44c",
      "text": "事务所",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:648284ee4d1f961776401431265bfd5d8c3aff083b3341ec9a95c4c758e439e0",
      "text": "花音君，下一份工作定下来了哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0d3589e88360af99f802f7e93c69a1fada9591226ec36f5dcc20529d633cafcf",
      "text": "哇，接下来是什么样的工作？\n要是可爱的工作就太好啦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0cb9b3e9a9bd6f7aa34efb4dab9be018702102214652436d4b28537046108c8a",
      "text": "虽然不是可爱的工作，\n但这次是和冬马先生一起的工作哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ebacdfbec5ca000e25b2a35d5e850f533d73f7be63bebdb0201a6ec62c02aad3",
      "text": "跟、跟冬马君一起！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d456474125f044232071f5a6a07a51eeb2bc92ddea74d14780897dcbbf1806f4",
      "text": "是的，没错哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f704e957261810d2b2da58538f44393f07dab75a0ec805660658c16e17932579",
      "text": "怎、怎么办才好……！！\n花音超——级开心的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cec1944b6a14dcfb56a4e72df67cfd40533640b0da5d76fdddc936da8b1e7803",
      "text": "那个呢，花音是冬马君的粉丝哦！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000058:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f26b5d9d8c6d8dfe598ea472a8b3ca5c9089153bf7b67bd68999e8627b926905",
      "text": "在事务所第一次打招呼的时候，他对我超级\n温柔的。从那之后我就变成粉丝了♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6f58a1fcb2b1f577f22f0bea789e79ce672ac7daacb29a41219cd899a7b26873",
      "text": "能一起工作真让人期待呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_034kan_01_1_2_034_01:1_2_034_01_a:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2392e0cddb328c893f17d98721cf80c81b55affbf5b5de8d07bb617690527536",
      "text": "嗯！花音要为了和冬马君的\n工作超——级努力才行～！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
